# The presented site is plain pages plus exactly two number-free data
# files (the crate's releases.json and the heartbeat pulse.json) and the
# health function that reads the pulse from its bundle. Everything else
# below stays in the repo for the private build, and none of it is ever
# deployed. Play data is never published: data/captures and every other
# data file stay behind this wall, and scripts/strip_public.py fails the
# build if a banned key ever reaches a published JSON.
data/*
!data/v1
data/v1/*
!data/v1/releases.json
!data/v1/pulse.json
api/*
!api/health.js
lib/*
!lib/envelope.js
!lib/ratelimit.js
.github/
skills/
tests/
scripts/
logs/
*.md
llms.txt
llms-full.txt
.gitattributes

# Foundry cover archive (Round 851): provenance copies of the Apple-served
# covers; the archive of record, never deployed, never page-referenced.
assets/covers/
